        "original_id": "2e2454cf-adfd-5011-878c-b46d41d9c348",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Scarlet Letter (1995 film)\n- People: Roland Joffé, Demi Moore, Gary Oldman, Robert Duvall, Gary Leonard Oldman, Emilio Estevez, Anthony Michael Hall, Rob Lowe, Andrew McCarthy, Judd Nelson, Molly Ringwald, Ally Sheedy\n- Companies: Cinergi Pictures\n- Organizations: Brat Pack\n- Topics: film cast, box office bombs\n\nFacts:\n- Gary Leonard Oldman was born on 21 March 1958 and is an English actor, filmmaker, musician, and author who has worked in theatre, film, and television.\n- The Scarlet Letter is a 1995 American romantic drama film.\n- The Scarlet Letter was directed by Roland Joffé and stars Demi Moore, Gary Oldman, and Robert Duvall.\n- Demi Moore is considered one of the core members of the Brat Pack, along with Emilio Estevez, Anthony Michael Hall, Rob Lowe, Andrew McCarthy, Judd Nelson, Molly Ringwald, and Ally Sheedy.\n- Cinergi Pictures suffered a string of box office bombs that included The Scarlet Letter, and the company closed in 1998.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
